blend_tree Locomotion02250 parameter speed { idle at 0 walk at 1 run at 3 }
mask LowerBody { include [Hip, Knee, Foot] }
ik FootIK02250 chain [Hip, Knee, Foot] target GroundTarget iterations 10
retarget SourceRig3 -> Rig02250 map { Hips: Hip LeftFoot: Foot }
state_machine Move02250 { Idle -> Walk when speed > 0.1 Walk -> Run when speed > 2.0 Run -> Idle when speed == 0 }
root_motion from Root axes [x,z]
